            "review_title": "Review at Tiệm cơm Mãn Túc",
            "review_text": "Global28995396385\n2 contributions\n0\nA random stop that turned into a great find\nAug 2026 • Friends\nWe randomly stopped by this Chinese restaurant with a few friends because we were looking for somewhere to have lunch, and honestly, we didn’t expect much. But it turned out to be such a pleasant surprise.\n\nThe food was really comforting and flavorful, especially the Dongpo pork and the tofu with minced pork sauce. Everything tasted homemade rather than overly fancy, which we really enjoyed.\n\nWe ended up ordering more dishes than we planned because everyone wanted to try something else. 😂 The restaurant has a cozy atmosphere, and it’s a nice place to sit down, share a few dishes, and catch up with friends.\n\nDefinitely one of those random places you stumble upon and end up being glad you did. Would happily come back to try more dishes!\nRead more\nWritten August 21, 2026",
